WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.677
Watch and read: How many parts can you clap in the word “pencil”?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:08.117
The answer is: 2. Say the word slowly and clap its syllables.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:13.588
Watch and read: Ama asks: You see the new word “market”. Which parts help you read

00:00:13.588 --> 00:00:13.878
it?

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.988
The answer is: mar-ket. Break longer words into syllables, then blend them.
